---
import Shell from '../../../layouts/Shell.astro';
import ArticleReadingPath from '../../../components/ArticleReadingPath.astro';
import '../../../styles/article-reading.css';
import story from '../../../../../../kb/research/stories/when-the-goddess-comes-to-the-wall.json';
const title='The Year That Feeds Us';
const description='Stories of cultivation, food, seasonal observances and the people who carry them forward.';
---
<Shell title={title} description={description} active="explore" wide related={false}>
 <div class="article-reading seasonal-series">
  <a href="/explore/">← Explore Project Odisha</a>
  <header><h1>{title}</h1><p class="series-dek">Nature, food and the celebration of life in Odisha</p></header>
  <p>The year can be followed through seed, soil, rain and the food that reaches a shared meal. It can also be followed through the people who cultivate, cook, keep vows and pass on what they know.</p>
  <p><em>The Year That Feeds Us</em> brings these relationships into view through stories of Odisha’s seasonal life. Each reading stays close to particular people and places, making room for the different meanings a tradition can hold.</p>
  <ArticleReadingPath id="series-stories" heading="Stories in this series" links={[{href:story.route,title:story.title,description:story.description}]}/>
  <p class="article-update"><a href="/contribute/?page=%2Fstories%2Fthe-year-that-feeds-us%2F">Suggest an update</a>. GitHub submissions are public; omit private contact details and consent documents.</p>
 </div>
</Shell>
<style>
 .seasonal-series>header{margin-block:2rem}
 .series-dek{font-size:1.2rem;color:var(--muted)}
 .article-update{font-size:.9rem;margin-top:2.5rem}
</style>
